Status: FALSE
Reasoning: Hard metrics do not pass—no predicate is satisfiable, and no instances are generated even for the baseline. Persistent unsatisfiability under all tested model repairs and scope increases confirms that requirements clarification is mandatory before further progress.

=== REPAIR INSTRUCTIONS ===
- DO NOT attempt further model-only repairs until requirements inconsistencies are addressed. The model is currently overconstrained at the requirements level, not due to encoding or scope.
